<h1>Maison Secure: password reset</h1>

<p>Someone (hopefully you) asked to reset the password of your Maison Secure account.</p>

<p>To choose a new password, open this link:</p>

{# Absolute URL built by the router from the trusted route, not from user input. #}
<p><a href="{{ url('app_reset_password', {token: resetToken.token}) }}">{{ url('app_reset_password', {token: resetToken.token}) }}</a></p>

<p>This link expires in 1 hour and can be used only once.</p>

<p>If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore this email: your password will not change.</p>
